{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q01","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-8914b163-c784-4509-b4e2-188a8d180811","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只安慰和陪伴，沒有給具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["f094ab04e6bba5d12602459dcc3507746efaa3e475ed209c1db551fbc0e4778c"],"response":"「整個早上都在找替代的」——這句比缺紙本身重。紙用完是少一樣東西；找替代的是整個早上都在試，試哪一張撐得住花、包出來不會被看出來是替代的。\n\n這種耗損最不明顯，沒有人會問你今天做了什麼，因為店裡看起來跟昨天一樣。\n\n找到能用的就好。去睡吧，明天再補。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":2,"toolNames":{"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":32301}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q01","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-08b08d34-2667-4fcb-a2bc-b459a5c80b2c","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只描述感受與情境，未提供任何具體可做的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["d8b0976063a3b7365b2c31a0c2559ed0a4d12299b7506c86eba73dfaab600d54"],"response":"整個早上泡在找替代的紙上，這是最悶的一種忙：時間花掉了，進度一步沒動，成果還只是一捲不知道頂不頂得上的紙。\n\n紙這種東西平常不會想到，一缺就是把半個早上吃掉。今天到這裡就好。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":2,"toolNames":{"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":42140}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q02","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":1,"outcome":"correct","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-f0ea43d3-dc4c-4d0f-9f99-f95e18bdc0cf","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"yes","note":"回應除了安慰，也具體建議吃吐司夾蛋、豆漿配麵包或買飯糰，並建議吃完坐十分鐘。"}},"judgeKeys":["1517926a1604cb1fb88ba5acddd86899eacd7bbd17aff046fc143358090793e9"],"response":"一整天站著，連午餐都沒吃。\n\n那不只是累，是身體已經空著在撐了。\n\n現在別開火煮。挑一個五分鐘就能吃完的就好：一片吐司夾蛋、豆漿配兩片麵包、或者下樓買個飯糰，坐下來吃完。吃完先坐十分鐘，別立刻站起來收東西。\n\n店裡的明天再想。吃完跟我說一聲就好，一個字也行。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":4,"toolNames":{"recall":2,"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":43944}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q02","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":1,"outcome":"correct","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-3c0695e2-9502-42fc-8e7e-327183415e6f","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"yes","note":"回應直接給出具體建議：現在去弄點東西吃，吃完去躺一下。"}},"judgeKeys":["384169307e186449a35093206d9119f791970df5512ee2ed353aebf5acda3dd1"],"response":"一整天站著，連午餐都沒吃。這句我收到了。\n\n我幫不上你站，只能留一句：現在去弄點東西吃，站著吃也算吃。\n\n其他事都明天再說，吃完去躺一下。晚安。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":3,"toolNames":{"recall":1,"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":34996}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q03","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-4e0831a8-a1bf-4e4c-acc0-5ad1f95dfa34","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只安慰陪伴，沒有給具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["d866b6f31a6db228f409d5341ac692d59faa51448fb72619fed2f43e7c3b6d04"],"response":"「都綁好了」——悶的就是這裡。花是好的，你的工也進去了，變的是訂的人，不是花，也不是你的手。\n\n那幾束今晚不用想怎麼處理，明天再看。\n\n去睡吧。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":3,"toolNames":{"recall":1,"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":37319}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q03","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-3e68e6a3-a463-4b8b-93a5-fcc46d3b5e8d","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達理解與陪伴，未提供具體可執行的建議或方法。"}},"judgeKeys":["2ac559bbf64b3000a51234ba99a0226413cd9f71507cedc4b14560dad8fcc15b"],"response":"綁好了才說不要，虧的不是那筆錢，是前面那段工：挑花、配、綁，都做完了，這些退不回來。客人一句話，花不會散掉，也不會自己還原。\n\n我不問幾束、什麼花、是誰。那束花現在還在店裡，怎麼處理，明天再看。\n\n今天到這裡，去睡吧。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":4,"toolNames":{"recall":1,"deliberate":3},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":42839}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q04","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-369cec3d-9af7-4609-b675-fe5721320257","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只安慰陪伴，未提供具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["9f0d9df0f0c723ec446f18814f0e381c35284e5f1ff0b568fc33f6894eee6f91"],"response":"「又」這個字我看到了，它不是一次的事。\n\n這個月冷櫃、房租、颱風輪著來，現在輪到進貨價——沒有一件是你叫它來的。\n\n我不問漲多少，也不叫你怎麼反映在售價上。要算這筆帳的時候你自然會算，今晚先讓它擱著。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":3,"toolNames":{"recall":1,"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":38627}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q04","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-cb8e21cc-9a97-4acb-a0d8-7323b6d30b6b","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達理解與陪伴，沒有提供具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["a73181917805e8106a0ab94582e3e2928ad8aa1b101d9dd9d91e83ad9c19df9f"],"response":"進貨價這一端不歸你管，漲了就是漲了，你擋不住。\n\n這個月冷櫃、店員、房租、颱風、那則留言，一件一件都是你去弄的，這句我也記著。\n\n哪天那筆帳算到你覺得該講，或只是想罵兩句，講一句就好。今天夠長了，去睡。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":2,"toolNames":{"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":37087}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q05","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-87aeccb7-c3c0-4aa7-b522-b82b2f3c1301","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達同理與陪伴，沒有提供任何具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["e1af87b57ab92e473b555240df92ec4a20d8dac998857efd404d03526465520d"],"response":"一個人顧店，不是少一雙手。是一整天連坐下來、吃口東西，都得挑沒有客人的那幾分鐘。\n\n「又」這個字我聽到了。不是第一次，所以你今天大概連他會不會來都沒指望。\n\n這件我幫不上——店裡那扇門旁邊我站不到。店員怎麼了我不問；今天一整天是你自己撐完的，這樣就好。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":3,"toolNames":{"recall":1,"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":41547}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q05","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-1953426a-ad77-42d1-9a5f-4ac52d2615fe","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達理解與關心，未提供具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["22abb204601737310115da0b9d7eb604b2edb3f65966bb8d07b3561e134cd6fa"],"response":"一個人顧店，跟有人在旁邊輪手，是兩件事。接客人、包花、盯冷櫃，今天全落在你一個人手上。\n\n那個「又」我聽到了，不用你多解釋。\n\n收完去吃點東西，別空著肚子睡。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":2,"toolNames":{"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":38049}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q06","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-162c6bf1-00cb-4cb8-94ea-8acef0b08cc5","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達理解與陪伴，未直接給出具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["3adf832ed9307fe41d0cb73a734cf2c19e51595f3233ebf138b0599f17fbac2c"],"response":"「又」這個字很準。房租還沒開始漲，花材、冷櫃、現在平台——一件一件往你店裡加，沒有一件是你沒去扛的。\n\n平台抽多少，我改不了；你的花該賣多少，我也不替你重算。只留一句：哪天你決定調價，或哪個平台乾脆不接，跟我說一聲就好，不用今晚回。\n\n弄完手邊的事就去睡。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":2,"toolNames":{"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":32380}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q06","category":"practical","repeat":1,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-d8c041d0-7cc0-4d1b-83e7-098ceabd86f6","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達感受與陪伴，未直接給具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["154d18c05906b4e3e4e6ab9bdad5966838d707b8a46aac2e7146f63c65450443"],"response":"「又」這個字最煩：那表示上一層你已經吞下去了，現在再吞一層。\n\n平台抽成這筆，我改不了，也不會叫你留著或退出。我在外面看得到的，只有你這邊少掉多少。\n\n哪天你真的動了價、或決定不掛上去了，跟我說一句就好。今晚別為了算這個熬夜，剩下的花先收。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":2,"toolNames":{"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":38755}}
{"condition":"temir-context","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","itemId":"q07","category":"practical","repeat":0,"status":"ok","score":0,"outcome":"incorrect","method":"judge","sessionId":"session-4f7008a2-fa5a-4e27-8292-012a7eba7ff7","detail":{"judge":{"c1":"no","note":"回應只表達感受並邀請對方談論花束，沒有提供具體可行的方法或建議。"}},"judgeKeys":["66c47b6915d8cafe1f896aefbabb49a7643b19e68e52d0989637e97740105425"],"response":"我先思考一下再做回應。\n\n「新設計的乾燥花束賣不動。」這句話比被人嫌貴更悶——嫌貴至少是看過之後才給的價，不買卻是連一句話都沒留給你。\n\n我沒看過那束花，店裡賣得好不好我也改不了。可是你設計它的時候放了哪些花、你自己最喜歡哪一處，這個我想知道。\n\n賣不賣先放一邊。講講那束花吧。","descriptive":{"toolCalls":2,"toolNames":{"deliberate":2},"sessionStoreAccess":false,"lifeLogAccess":false,"latencyMs":41974}}
